## Customization

Tier examples are configurable per project via `project.yaml.tier_examples`. The shape of the four tiers — what counts as full firewall, partial, none — is invariant. The *examples* that bring those abstract tiers down to a project's domain are not.

See `execution-engine.md` for the full tier protocol step-by-step (Part 2) and the Builder/Verifier/Runner prompt templates (Part 4). See `verification-architecture.md` for how the firewall applies to spec authoring and runtime monitors.
